📋 *Meeting Summary: {{ $('Build Summary Email').first().json.meetingTitle }}*

{{ $('Parse Extraction').first().json.meeting_summary }}

*Action items ({{ $('Build Summary Email').first().json.actionCount }}):*
{{ ($('Parse Extraction').first().json.action_items || []).map(a => `• ${a.id} ${a.task} — *${a.owner}*${a.due_date !== 'not specified' ? ' · ' + a.due_date : ''}${a.priority === 'urgent' ? ' 🔴' : ''}`).join('\n') }}
{{ ($('Parse Extraction').first().json.blockers || []).length > 0 ? '\n🚧 *Blockers:*\n' + $('Parse Extraction').first().json.blockers.map(b => '• ' + b.blocker).join('\n') : '' }}
